      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "social-network/\n│\n├── backend/            # Server code (Go)\n│   ├── cmd/            # Entry points\n│   │   └── server/\n│   │       └── main.go # Starts the server\n│   │\n│   ├── internal/       # Private app logic\n│   │   ├── auth/       # Login & Register\n│   │   ├── users/      # User profiles\n│   │   └── utils/      # Shared helpers (Hash, Time)\n│   │\n│   └── pkg/            # Public packages\n│       └── db/         # Database config & migrations\n│\n├── frontend/           # UI code (Next.js)\n│   ├── src/            # Main source code\n│   │   ├── app/        # Pages and routes\n│   │   │   ├── (auth)/ # Auth routes\n│   │   │   └── profile/# Profile routes\n│   │   │\n│   │   ├── components/ # Reusable UI parts (Lego blocks)\n│   │   │   └── ui/     # Buttons, inputs, cards\n│   │   │\n│   │   └── utils/      # Helper functions (API, formats)\n│   │\n│   └── public/         # Static files (images, fonts)\n│\n└── docker-compose.yml  # Runs both backend & frontend",
      "fontSize": 26.13397524870378,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "social-network/\n│\n├── backend/            # Server code (Go)\n│   ├── cmd/            # Entry points\n│   │   └── server/\n│   │       └── main.go # Starts the server\n│   │\n│   ├── internal/       # Private app logic\n│   │   ├── auth/       # Login & Register\n│   │   ├── users/      # User profiles\n│   │   └── utils/      # Shared helpers (Hash, Time)\n│   │\n│   └── pkg/            # Public packages\n│       └── db/         # Database config & migrations\n│\n├── frontend/           # UI code (Next.js)\n│   ├── src/            # Main source code\n│   │   ├── app/        # Pages and routes\n│   │   │   ├── (auth)/ # Auth routes\n│   │   │   └── profile/# Profile routes\n│   │   │\n│   │   ├── components/ # Reusable UI parts (Lego blocks)\n│   │   │   └── ui/     # Buttons, inputs, cards\n│   │   │\n│   │   └── utils/      # Helper functions (API, formats)\n│   │\n│   └── public/         # Static files (images, fonts)\n│\n└── docker-compose.yml  # Runs both backend & frontend",
